WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Your cohort is a group of classmates moving through the same process.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Participation does not have to mean speaking first or speaking often.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
You can observe, encourage, respond, share a resource, or invite one follow-up conversation.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Start with the level of interaction that feels useful today. Belonging grows through small, genuine contributions.
